/steam/apps/3963680/extras/f9ca5603107d4fd8118cf95d1ddb5470.webm?t=1761922402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963680/extras/f9ca5603107d4fd8118cf95d1ddb5470.mp4?t=1761922402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical dice management: each villager is a die with its own class, value, and possible upgrades.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies and combos: buildings that boost each other based on their position or what you have in play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963680/extras/c7906b27fce75da6277bab06e9043bd3.poster.avif?t=1761922402\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963680/extras/c7906b27fce75da6277bab06e9043bd3.webm?t=1761922402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability: random maps and multiple paths to optimize.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round you choose a building from several offered to you, build/place it, assign dices to the buildings and collect the results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buildings can interact with each other, be influenced by the environment, or change their function depending on whether they have a die assigned or not. Furthermore, depending on their functions, a high-roll die may not always be necessary or desirable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dices are divided on classes ( neutral, farmer, merchant, soldier, etc.) that modify or improve their use in different buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist to stay update!</p>","developers":["Rub\u00e9n Arranz"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3685190","name":"Roll & Reign"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963680/73463ad741ecd38ac7b0a65a093ece436c34e85f/header.jpg?t=1761922402","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963680/443212236/44e54433ca3e0bba421a8ba8f4b4ede4d28a5e37/1757608742/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761324341","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963680/443212236/44e54433ca3e0bba421a8ba8f4b4ede4d28a5e37/1757608742/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761324341","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963680/443212236/44e54433ca3e0bba421a8ba8f4b4ede4d28a5e37/1757608742/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761324341","id":257196333,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196333/movie480.mp4?t=1761324341","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196333/movie_max.mp4?t=1761324341"},"name":"Trailer Roll & Reign","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257196333/049587b8b2ca0c221ae809da2de3877736acdbd6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761324341","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196333/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1761324341","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257196333/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1761324341"}}],"name":"Roll & Reign Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel core i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATI Radeon HD 4850 o NVIDIA GeForce 9600 GT<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Tarjeta de sonido compatible con DirectX<br></li><li><s